            "review_title": "Review at Narak Thai Kitchen",
            "review_text": "Hannah Schoepple\n14 contributions\n0\nCan’t Miss This Spot in HCMC!\nMay 2025 • Family\nEverything here was amazing! We ended up getting 10+ dishes to try as a group and there were no misses. Everything was flavorful and spiced to perfection. My personal favorites were the tangerine juice, eggs with tamarind sauce, shrimp & lychee curry and the chè chaktuchak - but seriously, you won’t be disappointed with whatever you choose! The service was great and the food came out fast. The music was on point and the atmosphere is so modern and fresh. You’ll regret it if you don’t visit this restaurant when you’re in HCMC!\nRead more\nInsider tip:\nBring a group so you can try many dishes!\nValue\nService\nFood\nAtmosphere\nWritten May 22, 2025",
