            "review_text": "Phat V\n13 contributions\n0\nDon’t miss this spot for delicious Thai food in HCMC!\nMay 2025 • Family\nGreat food options for everyone. Every dish was well seasoned, with lots of different variety from Thai soups, salads, and main courses. I recommend going in a group to be able to try everything. \n\nSome dishes I recommend you try are the tom yum soup, soft shell crab, green curry fried rice, lychee curry, chicken and pork satay, tangerine juice, and Thai chè.\nRead more\nWritten May 22, 2025",
